{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉行政總裁埃隆·馬斯克近日就公司停產Cybertruck的決定作出回應，強調這款備受爭議的不鏽鋼電動皮卡並非因為虧損而停產，同時表示，由於現有訂單數量仍高於剩餘產能，部分用户最終將獲得訂金退款。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585642.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.409989+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:26:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"761209936249c4dcd3952432f408143c320e6e5a88d391f198d48f6761f15d90","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}